==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6~18 seconds<sup>180f~540f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 7.33~12.67 seconds<sup>220f~380f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Take out the Dagshunds using [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], stalling them with [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]]. The Celeboodles should be easy enough, using the same strategy.

